# PUT request to update the details of a specific expected payment
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/payments/admin/expected_payments/1/configure_expected_payments/
Authorization: Bearer <your-access-token>

### Request body (payload) for updating the expected payment:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "total_amount": "5000.00",
  "calculation_date": "2025-01-25T00:00:00Z",  # New calculation date
  "due_date": "2025-02-05T23:59:59Z",  # New due date
  "status": "pending",  # You can update the status if needed
  "payment_date": null,  # Payment date can remain null unless the payment is made
  "assets": [1, 2, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16]  # New asset list if needed, you can leave the same or modify
}

